From bc0267d593ece09ba85a63685a5a8289b4cd7b5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mir Mohammad Sajedul Islam <mohammad.sajedul.islam@g.bracu.ac.bd>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 06:30:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Rebuild the admin panel and lock unpaid students out

Admin (mobile first)
- Overview with a subscription bar (active, expiring, expired, not paid),
  key numbers, who needs attention and a batch breakdown.
- Students list with search, status filters, batch filter and sorting.
  Tapping a name opens their progress by subject and chapter, streak,
  28-day activity and payment history, with cash renewal, undo, edit,
  revoke access and delete.
- Lectures (YouTube), study sheets (Google Drive) and notices tabs.

Students
- Unpaid or expired students see one renewal notice in Bangla and nothing
  else; saved lecture lists on the phone are cleared.
- Renewal warnings and renewal confirmations show as a banner.
